<section class="section-brand-story" id="brand-story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand-story-grid">
      
      <div class="story-content">
        <span class="story-tag">THE MANIFESTO</span>
        <h2 class="story-heading">
          NOT JUST A HOODIE.<br>
          AN ARMOR OF SILENT LUXURY.
        </h2>
        <div class="story-text">
          <p>
            <strong>VIMI</strong> was conceived with an obsession: most hoodies in the market either felt lightweight, lost shape after two washes, or had rigid unflattering box fits.
          </p>
          <p>
            We spent 9 months developing our custom <strong>450 GSM French Terry</strong> fabric right here in India — dense enough to maintain an architectural drop-shoulder drape without being overly hot for Indian weather.
          </p>
          <p>
            No fast fashion shortcuts. Every stitch, flatlock seam, and double-layered hood is reinforced to withstand years of everyday wear.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="story-metrics">
          <div class="metric-item">
            <span class="metric-num">450</span>
            <span class="metric-label">GSM Heavyweight</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-item">
            <span class="metric-num">100%</span>
            <span class="metric-label">Combed Cotton</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-item">
            <span class="metric-num">0%</span>
            <span class="metric-label">Polyester Blend</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="story-visual">
        <div class="story-card">
          <div class="story-card-inner">
            <div class="story-badge">CRAFTED FOR CULTURE</div>
            <div class="fabric-macro-visual">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 320 220" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="fabric-svg">
                <rect width="320" height="220" rx="12" fill="#111111"/>
                <pattern id="terryWeave" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                  <path d="M 0 10 Q 5 0, 10 10 T 20 10" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  <path d="M 0 20 Q 5 10, 10 20 T 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#1d1d1d" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                </pattern>
                <rect width="320" height="220" fill="url(#terryWeave)"/>
                <circle cx="160" cy="110" r="60" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4" fill="none"/>
                <circle cx="160" cy="110" r="4" fill="#f59e0b"/>
                <text x="160" y="145" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" font-family="'Syne', sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="12" letter-spacing="2">VIMI LABS SPEC: 450 GSM</text>
                <text x="160" y="165" text-anchor="middle" fill="#777777" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="9">LOOPBACK TERRY • PRE-SHRUNK</text>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="story-quote">
              <p>"The weight tells you everything before you even look in the mirror."</p>
              <span>— VIMI Design Team, Mumbai</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Brand Story",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Brand Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
